  "description": "This dataset contains electroencephalogram (EEG) recordings from 15 university students (8 males, 7 females; ages 21-23) collected to investigate brain connectivity during learning processes involving generative AI. Participants performed essay-writing tasks under different AI interaction conditions to assess cognitive states such as creativity, memory, and critical thinking.",
